:: Warrior Setup
<<set $player_class to "Warrior">>
<<set $strength to 15>>
<<set $agility to 10>>
<<set $intelligence to 10>>
<<set $vitality to 13>>
<<set $max_hp to 60>>
<<set $hp to 60>>
<<set $inventory to ["Iron Sword", "Wooden Shield", "Traveler's Clothes"]>>
<<set $has_iron_sword to true>>

# The Warrior's Path

You are $player_name, a seasoned warrior. Your muscles are hard-earned from years on the road. You carry a trusty iron sword and a wooden shield -- nothing fancy, but they've kept you alive.

''Starting Stats:''
- Strength: $strength
- Agility: $agility
- Intelligence: $intelligence
- Vitality: $vitality
- HP: $hp / $max_hp
- Gold: $gold
- Inventory: <<print $inventory.join(", ")>>

You feel ready to face whatever Thornwood has in store.

[[Enter Thornwood|Town Square]]
